      "text": "(1) The Departmental Modification form submitted by a department in accordance with Section 124 (a) of the New York City Charter shall be validated by the Director of the Budget or his authorized representative who shall sign four copies which shall be distributed as follows: two (2) copies sent to the Office of the Comptroller, one (1) returned to the department for payroll entry, and the copy retained by the Bureau of the Budget is to be used to update the Master Budget.",
